            <field name="task_type">inspection</field>
            <field name="priority">2</field>
            <field name="active" eval="True"/>
            <field name="description"><![CDATA[
                <h3>Access Control System Verification</h3>
                <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Verify proper functioning of all access control systems and ensure only authorized personnel gain entry to restricted areas.</p>
                
                <h4>Key Responsibilities:</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Test all card readers and biometric scanners</li>
                    <li>Verify access logs are being recorded properly</li>
                    <li>Check for any unauthorized access attempts</li>
                    <li>Ensure visitor management system is operational</li>
                    <li>Verify emergency override systems are functional</li>
                    <li>Report any system malfunctions immediately</li>
                </ul>
                
                <h4>UAE Standards:</h4>
                <p>Complies with UAE data protection laws and SIRA guidelines for access control management in secured facilities.</p>
