                <h4>Inspection Protocol:</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Verify vehicle registration and driver authorization</li>
                    <li>Check vehicle for prohibited items or contraband</li>
                    <li>Inspect trunk and cargo areas when required</li>
                    <li>Use mirrors to check vehicle undercarriage</li>
                    <li>Log vehicle details in the register</li>
                    <li>Issue vehicle pass or parking permit</li>
                    <li>Report suspicious vehicles to supervisor</li>
